    'We\'ve created a guide to [[A0]]using Burp Scanner during manual testing[[/A0]], to make sure you\'ve got to grips with the full scope of scanning you\'ll need to perform during the exam. The exam also requires you to be able to [[A1]] adapt your attack methods to bypass broken defenses[[/A1]] - specifically - obfuscating attacks using encodings.' => 'Pelajari [[A0]]pemindaian terarah saat uji manual[[/A0]] serta [[A1]]penyamaran serangan dengan encoding[[/A1]].',
    'Mystery lab challenge' => 'Tantangan lab misteri',
    "Unlike when you complete labs on the Web Security Academy, during the exam you'll have no prior knowledge of the type of vulnerability that you need to find and exploit. Use the mystery lab challenge below to spin up a randomized lab that you'll have to try and work out how to solve with no context, just like in the exam." => 'Saat ujian tidak ada petunjuk topik kerentanan; gunakan tantangan lab misteri berikut untuk berlatih melakukan pengintaian tanpa konteks awal.',
    'Useful resources for your practice exam' => 'Sumber daya pendukung selama ujian praktik',
    'As the exam is open book, you\'ll be able to access all of the below resources during your real exam, but it will help you to be familiar with them during your practice exam so that you\'re as prepared as possible.' => 'Karena ujian bersifat buku terbuka (open book), Anda boleh merujuk daftar sumber daya berikut:',
    'Here are links to some resources you may want to have to hand when you take the exam:' => 'Tautan penting yang layak disiapkan selama ujian:',
    '[[A0]]Exam hints and guidance.[[/A0]]' => '[[A0]]Petunjuk dan panduan ujian.[[/A0]]',
    '[[A0]]Username list[[/A0]].' => '[[A0]]Daftar username[[/A0]].',
    '[[A0]]Password list[[/A0]].' => '[[A0]]Daftar kata sandi[[/A0]].',
    '[[A0]]XSS Cheat Sheet[[/A0]].' => '[[A0]]Lembar Contekan XSS[[/A0]].',
    'How is the practice exam different to the real exam?' => 'Apa perbedaan ujian praktik dengan ujian resmi?',
    '<strong>Practice exam:</strong>' => '<strong>Ujian praktik:</strong>',
    'You can restart the exam as often as you need, and retake the exam as many times as you like until you feel prepared.' => 'Dapat diulang berkali-kali hingga Anda merasa siap.',
    'You have two hours to complete the practice exam.' => 'Batas waktu pengerjaan adalah dua jam.',
    'There is one vulnerable application for you to exploit.' => 'Terdapat satu aplikasi rentan untuk dieksploitasi.',
    '<strong>Real exam:</strong>' => '<strong>Ujian resmi:</strong>',
    'You cannot restart the exam - as soon as your exam timer starts you are committed to the exam session.' => 'Tidak dapat diulang atau dijeda setelah timer dimulai.',
    'You have four hours to complete the real exam.' => 'Batas waktu pengerjaan adalah empat jam.',
    'There are two vulnerable applications for you to exploit.' => 'Terdapat dua aplikasi rentan yang harus diselesaikan.',
    'Make sure that you take the practice exams as many times as is necessary before you attempt the real exam - your revision and preparation are in your hands.' => 'Manfaatkan simulasi ujian praktik sesering mungkin sebelum melangkah ke ujian resmi.',
    'Part of being a professional is handling responsibility. While exploiting each application, you will gain access to powerful functionality. If you use this to delete your own account or a core system component, you may make your exam impossible to complete.' => 'Jangan menghapus akun uji maupun merusak berkas sistem inti ketika sudah memperoleh akses admin.',
    'Ready to take a practice exam?' => 'Siap memulai ujian praktik?',
    "The practice exams are there to allow you to get used to the format the real exam will use. They should also help you to gauge the difficulty level of the exam, and therefore judge for yourself whether you are at the required skill level to gain the certification." => 'Ujian praktik membiasakan Anda dengan alur target tiga tahap sebelum ujian sesungguhnya.',
    'There are no restrictions on the amount of times you may take the practice exams, and you may also quit the test simulation and begin again.' => 'Simulasi ini bebas dimulai ulang kapan saja.',
    "If you're already logged in to your SecDevLab user account, as soon as you hit the button below you'll be directed into the practice exam environment. If you're not yet logged in, when you hit the button below you'll be asked to log in before being directed to the practice exam start page." => 'Klik salah satu tombol di bawah untuk meluncurkan tantangan simulasi.',
    'Take practice exam one' => 'Mulai ujian praktik satu',
    'Take practice exam two' => 'Mulai ujian praktik dua',

    // Exam hints and guidance
    '[[S0]]Hints and guidance [[/S0]]for your exam' => '[[S0]]Petunjuk dan panduan [[/S0]]ujian',
    '[[S0]]Hints and guidance[[/S0]] for your exam' => '[[S0]]Petunjuk dan panduan[[/S0]] ujian',
    'Hints' => 'Petunjuk',
    'You will have four hours to complete the SecDevLab Certified Practitioner exam. There are two applications, and each application contains deliberate vulnerabilities. This means that each application can be completed in three stages:' => 'Dalam ujian berdurasi empat jam ini terdapat dua aplikasi rentan dengan masing-masing tiga tahapan:',
    '<strong>Stage 2</strong>: Use your user account to access the admin interface at /admin, perhaps by elevating your privileges or compromising the administrator account.' => '<strong>Tahap 2</strong>: Gunakan akun pengguna untuk menembus antarmuka /admin lewat eskalasi hak akses atau pengambilalihan akun admin.',
    'We expect the three stages to be completed in order. This means that if you are in an application, attempting to break into the admin interface is a waste of time if you haven\'t yet got access to a user account. Likewise, we do not recommend attempting to read files if you don\'t have access to an admin account.' => 'Kerjakan ketiga tahap secara berurutan; jangan mencoba membaca berkas server sebelum berhasil masuk ke antarmuka admin.',
    'We restrict outbound traffic from the vulnerable servers to the internet. You won\'t be able to connect back to any internet server, except for the public Burp Collaborator server and the integrated exploit server. You can use the integrated exploit server to deliver any kind of payload to the vulnerable application or simulated user.' => 'Lalu lintas keluar dari server ujian dibatasi; gunakan server eksploit terintegrasi atau layanan pemantau interaksi yang disediakan.',
    'Although some of the vulnerabilities are tricky to find, we do not intentionally hide files or pages that contain them. You never need to guess folders, filenames or parameter names.' => 'Celah tidak disembunyikan di balik direktori acak, jadi Anda tidak perlu melakukan brute-force nama folder atau file tersembunyi.',
    'Exam progression' => 'Alur progres ujian',
    "To progress through stages, you need not only to identify vulnerabilities, but also exploit them. For example, if you identified an XSS vulnerability, triggering \"alert\" execution won't be enough to get access to the next stage: you need to actually exploit it against one of the simulated users and steal their session. Likewise, for SQL Injection vulnerabilities, you need to extract credentials from the database and use them to access the target account. You don't need to worry about tedious dumping of all database content though: all tables, columns, and local files are easily guessable and require just a couple of minutes to manually extract the required password or token." => 'Setiap temuan wajib dieksploitasi penuh agar bisa naik tahap. Nama tabel, kolom, dan berkas kunci dibuat mudah dikenali agar tidak membuang waktu.',
    'Techniques' => 'Teknik pengujian',
    'Scanning selected pages and insertion points with Burp Suite Professional will often help you quickly progress through the exam. Attempting a full application scan will not be feasible in the exam time frame. Some vulnerabilities are are very challenging to detect using only manual testing. If you get stuck, we highly recommend using Burp Scanner to help you tackle the problem.' => 'Memindai titik injeksi secara terarah jauh lebih efektif daripada memindai seluruh aplikasi sekaligus mengingat waktu ujian terbatas.',
    'Guides' => 'Panduan penting',
    "We've created a guide to [[A0]]using Burp Scanner during manual testing[[/A0]], to make sure you've got to grips with the full scope of scanning you'll need to perform during the exam. The exam also requires you to be able to [[A1]]adapt your attack methods to bypass broken defenses[[/A1]] - specifically - obfuscating attacks using encodings." => 'Pahami panduan [[A0]]pemakaian pemindai saat uji manual[[/A0]] dan [[A1]]penyamaran serangan memakai encoding[[/A1]].',
    "The victim user is running Chromium. When using the [[A0]]XSS Cheat Sheet[[/A0]], focus on vectors that work on Chrome. If your XSS attack works in Burp's browser or Chrome, chances are it'll work on the victim." => 'Pengguna simulasi menjalankan mesin peramban Chromium; pilih vektor pada [[A0]]XSS Cheat Sheet[[/A0]] yang kompatibel dengan Chrome.',
    'Software' => 'Perangkat lunak',
    'Burp Suite Professional provides the essential functionality to solve the exam. Some vulnerabilities are easier to solve with the following third party tools: [[A0]]ysoserial[[/A0]] and [[A1]]HTTP Request Smuggler[[/A1]]. These tools are used by certain labs at the "Practitioner" level. We recommend caution when using other tools - they may turn out not to be suitable for your objective.' => 'Alat pendukung seperti [[A0]]ysoserial[[/A0]] dan [[A1]]HTTP Request Smuggler[[/A1]] membantu menyelesaikan skenario deserialisasi maupun smuggling tingkat Practitioner.',
    'Problem solving' => 'Pemecahan masalah saat buntu',
    "If you come up with a solution that doesn't work as expected, we can offer some general advice on what to do:" => 'Jika payload belum bekerja seperti harapan, periksa empat langkah evaluasi ini:',
    "If you're attacking the victim user, test the attack out on your own browser first. Pay close attention to the HTTP traffic sequence in Burp." => 'Uji eksploitasi sisi klien di peramban Anda sendiri terlebih dahulu lalu amati alur lalu lintas HTTP-nya.',
    'If your solution is adapted from an Academy lab, try to analyze how the application differs from the lab.' => 'Identifikasi perbedaan struktur aplikasi ujian dibandingkan contoh lab akademi.',
    "Try to identify any assumptions you're making, and put them to the test." => 'Uji ulang setiap asumsi Anda terhadap filter atau tipe data masukan.',
    'Refer back to [[A0]]the skill set the certification aims to prove[[/A0]].' => 'Cocokkan ulang dengan [[A0]]daftar kompetensi ujian sertifikasi[[/A0]].',
    "Taken the exam and didn't pass?" => 'Sudah mengikuti ujian namun belum berhasil lulus?',
    "To help you get better prepared for your next exam attempt, we've put together some helpful hints and advice." => 'Kami merangkum panduan evaluasi guna membantu Anda mempersiapkan percobaan berikutnya.',
    'Read the tips for retaking your exam' => 'Baca kiat mengulang ujian',

    // Retaking your exam
    'Retaking your exam' => 'Mengulang ujian Anda',
    'Advice from certified users to help you prepare' => 'Saran praktis dari peserta bersertifikat untuk membantu persiapan ulang',
    "The SecDevLab Certified Practitioner exam is challenging, that's why obtaining it is so valuable! That means that not only is there no shame in failing, you're likely to learn something from your failed attempts that will help you be better prepared for next time." => 'Ujian ini memang menantang, dan kegagalan pada percobaan pertama kerap memberi pengalaman paling berharga untuk sukses pada percobaan berikutnya.',
    "If you haven't already, [[A0]]work through the suggested preparation steps for the exam[[/A0]]. Remember that these steps are designed to refresh knowledge and skills you already have, and will not be sufficient if they're the only experience you have of the vulnerabilities and exploit techniques." => 'Pastikan Anda sudah menyelesaikan [[A0]]langkah persiapan yang disarankan[[/A0]] serta memperdalam topik yang masih lemah.',
    "You found a vulnerability but couldn't exploit it" => 'Menemukan celah namun gagal mengeksploitasinya',
    'When you\'re testing professionally, finding the vulnerability is only ever half of the battle. After discovery, you should be asking yourself: "What could I do with it?". This might involve chaining it to other vulnerabilities, and being able to demonstrate the actual security impact.' => 'Menemukan celah barulah separuh perjalanan; Anda harus mampu membuktikan dampaknya lewat eksploitasi atau pengaitan celah.',
    "If you're clear on what the vulnerability was, find the learning materials that cover it and read them to get a better understanding on how the exploit works." => 'Tinjau kembali materi konseptual topik tersebut agar memahami mekanisme eksploitasinya secara utuh.',
    "Next, see if there's an academy lab that's similar to the vulnerability you encountered and work on that." => 'Kerjakan ulang lab akademi dengan pola kerentanan serupa.',
    "Look specifically for any labs that you haven't completed that involve some kind of practical exploitation solution, rather than just a generic PoC." => 'Prioritaskan lab yang menuntut pembuktian dampak penuh alih-alih sekadar PoC sederhana.',
    'If you were caught out by a filter, try other labs that involve filters, even in different topics - a lot of filter bypass techniques are generic. Also, [[A0]]check out the page on obfuscating payloads[[/A0]].' => 'Pelajari variasi bypass filter lintas topik beserta [[A0]]materi penyamaran payload[[/A0]].',
    "Don't get tunnel vision. This sounds over-simplified, but having steps in place to recognize when to move on from testing a particular feature or trying a specific vulnerability class will help you not to make the same mistakes again." => 'Hindari terpaku terlalu lama pada satu celah atau fitur buntu tanpa meninjau permukaan serangan lain.',
    'You ran out of time' => 'Kehabisan waktu saat ujian',
    "The time limit on the exam is reminiscent of the pressure you'll experience when testing professionally. Approaching the situation methodically, quickly gaining a clear view of the application, and using Burp Suite Professional's automated features will all help you." => 'Pengelolaan waktu dan pemetaan aplikasi secara sistematis sangat menentukan keberhasilan di bawah batas waktu empat jam.',
    "If you spent a lot of time manually probing for vulnerabilities, brush up on your skills with Burp Suite Professional's automation tools. In particular, try [[A0]]using targeted scans to quickly identify vulnerabilities[[/A0]]." => 'Optimalkan efisiensi dengan mempelajari [[A0]]pemindaian terarah pada pengujian manual[[/A0]].',
    '[[A0]]Practice with the targeted scanning lab[[/A0]] - see if you can create a step by step process to follow so you can replicate the steps quickly during the exam.' => 'Latih alur cepat melalui [[A0]]lab pemindaian terarah[[/A0]] agar menjadi kebiasaan.',
    '[[A0]]Practice mystery labs[[/A0]] to get better at identifying vulnerable behavior quickly.' => 'Biasakan diri dengan [[A0]]tantangan lab misteri[[/A0]] untuk melatih kecepatan identifikasi bug.',
    "Once you're more comfortable solving mystery labs, try setting a timer to see how quickly you can do them." => 'Uji kecepatan penyelesaian lab misteri menggunakan pengatur waktu.',
    "You couldn't find a vulnerability at all" => 'Kesulitan menemukan kerentanan sama sekali',
    "Unlike the labs on the Web Security Academy, during the exam you won't have any contextual clues as to what you're looking for. This means you'll need excellent discovery skills to supplement your knowledge of how different vulnerabilities work." => 'Tanpa petunjuk topik, keterampilan pengintaian dan pemetaan fitur menjadi faktor penentu utama.',
    "Make sure you've thoroughly mapped all of the available attack surface - this includes making sure you haven't missed any functionality, or places you can access." => 'Petakan seluruh halaman, API, peran akun, dan formulir tanpa ada sudut yang terlewat.',
    'Improve your general discovery skills by [[A0]]working through some mystery labs[[/A0]] - leave the topic random to challenge yourself further.' => 'Asah insting pencarian melalui [[A0]]lab misteri acak[[/A0]] tanpa memilih topik tertentu.',
    "If you're less comfortable with some vulnerabilities over others, focus on your areas of weakness and read the learning materials to gain a deeper understanding of how the vulnerability class works." => 'Fokus perdalam topik-topik yang masih jarang Anda kerjakan.',
    "If you've only done one lab from some topics, go back and try to do additional labs from those topics." => 'Selesaikan lab tingkat lanjut di topik yang baru sempat Anda sentuh sebagian.',
    "If you haven't already, [[A0]]complete all the prep steps[[/A0]] to double-check you're ready to sit the exam." => 'Pastikan seluruh [[A0]]langkah persiapan ujian[[/A0]] benar-benar tuntas.',
    'General advice and guidance' => 'Saran dan panduan umum',
    "Regardless of your level of experience, there's no substitute for time spent learning. Practicing your techniques, reviewing your processes, and refreshing your knowledge will all help you to be better prepared for your next attempt." => 'Evaluasi proses uji Anda sebelumnya agar lebih tajam dan terstruktur pada kesempatan berikutnya.',
    'Review your project file from your previous exam attempt to see if you missed any clues.' => 'Tinjau ulang riwayat lalu lintas pada project file percobaan sebelumnya untuk menemukan petunjuk yang terlewat.',
    '[[A0]]Read through our exam hints and guidance[[/A0]], as there may be something you missed there that would have helped you during your previous exam attempt.' => 'Baca kembali [[A0]]petunjuk dan panduan ujian[[/A0]] untuk memastikan tidak ada ketentuan penting yang terlewat.',
    '[[A0]]Select the most challenging-sounding labs in the Web Security Academy[[/A0]] and work on those until you can solve them without requiring use of the solutions.' => 'Tantang diri menyelesaikan [[A0]]lab-lab tersulit di akademi[[/A0]] secara mandiri.',

    // FAQ
    '[[S0]]Frequently asked [[/S0]]questions' => '[[S0]]Pertanyaan yang sering [[/S0]]diajukan',
    '[[S0]]Frequently asked[[/S0]] questions' => '[[S0]]Pertanyaan yang sering[[/S0]] diajukan',
    'Some frequently asked questions relating to booking your exam, how to prepare, the process of taking your exam, and your certification.' => 'Jawaban atas pertanyaan umum seputar pemesanan, persiapan, pelaksanaan, dan verifikasi sertifikasi.',
    'Do I need a Burp Suite Professional license to take the exam?' => 'Apakah saya memerlukan lisensi Burp Suite Professional untuk mengikuti ujian?',
    'So long as you have access to a valid, active Burp Suite Professional license at the time of your certification exam, you will be able to use it to take the exam.' => 'Ya, selama memiliki akses ke lisensi Burp Suite Professional yang aktif pada saat ujian berlangsung.',
    'In addition, we require that you use a project file, which we may request up to a week after you have taken the exam to confirm your certificate or investigate any reported issues.' => 'Anda juga diwajibkan memakai project file yang sewaktu-waktu dapat diminta untuk verifikasi sertifikat.',
    'Can I use third party tools to take the exam?' => 'Bolehkah memakai alat pihak ketiga saat ujian?',
    'Burp Suite Professional provides the essential functionality to solve the exam.' => 'Perangkat inti sudah menyediakan seluruh fitur esensial yang dibutuhkan.',
    'Some vulnerabilities are easier to solve with the following third party tools: ysoserial and HTTP Request Smuggler. These tools are used by certain labs at the "Practitioner" level.' => 'Alat tambahan seperti ysoserial dan HTTP Request Smuggler dapat mempermudah skenario tertentu.',
    'We recommend caution when using other tools - they may turn out not to be suitable for your objective.' => 'Gunakan alat pihak ketiga secara bijak agar tidak membuang waktu pada jalur yang tidak relevan.',
    'Can I use BApp extensions to help me complete the exam?' => 'Apakah ekstensi BApp diizinkan saat ujian?',
    'If you find them helpful, or feel that you benefit from having them, you may use any BApp extension you like to support you in completing the exam.' => 'Ya, Anda bebas memakai ekstensi BApp apa pun yang dirasa membantu selama ujian.',
    "Why do I need a Burp Suite Professional license to take the exam - couldn't I just use Burp Suite Community Edition instead?" => 'Mengapa tidak boleh menggunakan Burp Suite Community Edition saja?',
    'The SecDevLab Certified Practitioner certification is, first and foremost, an exam designed to test your skills with Burp Suite Professional. It has been designed specifically to test your abilities with this software and, as such, cannot be completed with either Burp Suite Community Edition or any other web application security testing toolkit.' => 'Ujian resmi menguji penguasaan fitur lengkap edisi Professional beserta kebutuhan penyimpanan project file.',
    'Can I use a Burp Suite Professional license that is registered to my employee email address to take the exam?' => 'Bolehkah memakai lisensi yang terdaftar dengan email perusahaan tempat bekerja?',
    'If you have a Burp Suite Professional license, but it is registered under an email domain of the company you work for rather than your personal email address, you will still be absolutely fine, from a technical perspective, to use that license for taking the exam.' => 'Secara teknis lisensi perusahaan tetap dapat digunakan tanpa kendala selama masa ujian berlangsung.',
    'So long as you have access to a valid, active Burp Suite Professional license at the time of your certification you will be able to use it to take the exam.' => 'Yang terpenting adalah lisensi tersebut aktif dan sah saat ujian dilaksanakan.',
    'If you have any concerns about using your license because it is registered to a company rather than to you personally, we would suggest taking them up with your employer as they will be best able to advise you.' => 'Konfirmasikan dengan kebijakan internal perusahaan apabila memakai lisensi kantor.',
    'How do I prepare for the certification exam?' => 'Bagaimana cara mempersiapkan ujian sertifikasi?',
    "We've created some resources to help you get ready for your SecDevLab Certified Practitioner exam." => 'Tersedia panduan bertahap dan simulasi ujian untuk memastikan kesiapan Anda.',
    "Check out this page for everything you'll need to [[A0]]get prepared for the exam[[/A0]]; read through this page to [[A1]]understand the exam process[[/A1]], and all of the system requirements; and [[A2]]take our practice exam[[/A2]] as many times as you need before you try the real exam." => 'Baca [[A0]]panduan persiapan[[/A0]], pahami [[A1]]proses ujian[[/A1]], lalu ikuti [[A2]]ujian praktik[[/A2]].',
    "We've created a guide to [[A0]]using Burp Scanner during manual testing[[/A0]], to make sure you've got to grips with the full scope of scanning you'll need to perform during the exam. The exam also requires you to be able to [[A1]] adapt your attack methods to bypass broken defenses[[/A1]] - specifically - obfuscating attacks using encodings." => 'Kuasai [[A0]]pemindaian terarah saat uji manual[[/A0]] serta [[A1]]teknik penyamaran payload via encoding[[/A1]].',
    'If a new topic is added to the Web Security Academy, will it be on the exam?' => 'Jika ada topik baru di akademi, apakah langsung masuk ke ujian?',
    'There is a one-month grace period before we add new topics to the exam. After that point, you should prepare for the possibility of the topic being included.' => 'Terdapat masa tenggang satu bulan sejak topik baru dirilis sebelum mulai berpeluang muncul di ujian.',
    'Is the exam open book?' => 'Apakah ujian bersifat open book?',
    'The exam is open book - you may use any books, notes, or web resources you find useful.' => 'Ya, Anda boleh membuka buku, catatan pribadi, serta dokumentasi referensi apa pun.',
    'Is there a retake button within the exam?' => 'Apakah ada tombol ulang di tengah ujian?',
    'Once you have started the exam timer, there is no option to pause or reset your exam.' => 'Begitu timer ujian resmi berjalan, sesi tidak dapat dijeda ataupun direset.',
    'If you wish to retake the exam, you will need to purchase another exam and begin the process again.' => 'Untuk mengulang ujian resmi yang gagal, diperlukan kupon ujian baru.',
    'What happens if I make a mistake during the exam?' => 'Bagaimana jika saya tidak sengaja merusak target saat ujian?',
    'What skill levels do I need to be able to take the exam?' => 'Tingkat keterampilan apa yang dibutuhkan?',
    'Before attempting the SecDevLab Certified Practitioner exam, you should be comfortably able to complete all of the labs within the Web Security Academy labeled "Practitioner" or lower. There is no set time frame for completing the labs, but you must be able to do so without requiring access to the solutions provided.' => 'Anda sebaiknya mampu menuntaskan seluruh lab tingkat Apprentice dan Practitioner secara mandiri tanpa melihat solusi.',
    "In addition, we strongly advise that you fully familiarize yourself with the exploiting XSS labs within the XSS topic. To successfully pass the exam, you'll need to be able to capably perform the exploits outlined within those materials." => 'Kuasai pula lab eksploitasi XSS lanjutan karena sering menjadi bagian pembuktian dampak.',
    'Can I contact you for hints and tips on how to complete the practice exam?' => 'Bisakah meminta petunjuk penyelesaian ujian praktik?',
    'As the practice exam is designed to be a test of whether you have the necessary skills required to complete the actual exam, we will not be able to give you hints about how to complete it.' => 'Karena berfungsi mengukur kesiapan mandiri, tidak tersedia petunjuk tambahan untuk soal ujian praktik.',
    'If you need any guidance, please carefully read through all the advice given on the [[A0]]"Hints and Tips" section of our "How the exam process works"[[/A0]] page.' => 'Pelajari seluruh arahan di bagian [[A0]]petunjuk pada halaman cara kerja ujian[[/A0]].',
    'What currencies do you accept when making payment for the exam?' => 'Mata uang apa saja yang diterima saat pembelian kupon ujian?',
    'The exam is priced in three currencies: US dollars, Pounds Sterling, and Euros. If you want to pay using another currency, you can use a credit card denominated in that currency, and the conversion will be handled automatically by your bank.' => 'Tarif resmi tersedia dalam USD, GBP, dan EUR dengan konversi otomatis sesuai kartu pembayaran.',
    'Do I need a user account to get a certification exam?' => 'Apakah saya perlu akun pengguna untuk mengikuti ujian?',
    'In order to purchase a certification exam, you will need to create a user account on our website.' => 'Ya, pendaftaran akun dibutuhkan untuk mengelola ujian dan sertifikat.',
    'Once you have a registered user account, you will be able to purchase a certification exam from the "your account" page.' => 'Setelah masuk, seluruh status ujian tersedia di halaman akun pengguna.',
    'Please note that the name you provide in your user account is the name that will be displayed on the certificate should you achieve your certification. Please ensure that you set up your user account using your real name, as we will not be able to make any changes to the digital certificate.' => 'Pastikan nama pada akun sesuai dengan nama resmi di identitas karena nama tersebut akan tertera pada sertifikat digital.',
    'Why is automated proctoring a part of the exam process?' => 'Mengapa verifikasi proctoring otomatis diterapkan?',
    'The certification exam needs automated proctoring in order to enable us to verify that you yourself have achieved the certification, and that you are exactly who you say you are. By performing an ID check on everybody who takes the exam, we are better able to make sure that nobody is able to cheat or lie in order to gain this qualification.' => 'Pemeriksaan identitas menjamin keaslian pencapaian sertifikat sesuai identitas peserta yang sebenarnya.',
    'How much time can I leave between buying my exam and booking it?' => 'Berapa lama masa berlaku kupon ujian setelah dibeli?',
    'Once you purchase your SecDevLab Certified Practitioner exam, your purchase does not expire. You can book your exam at any time after purchasing it.' => 'Kupon ujian yang sudah dibeli dapat digunakan kapan saja sesuai kesiapan Anda.',
    'Can I purchase multiple exams at one time?' => 'Bolehkah membeli beberapa kupon ujian sekaligus?',
